  "scope": "Current area-moment + exact quantized matching candidate; only incoming ghost packets receive fixed destination column equal to prescribed backtrace target i. Retained packets, ghost donor/flux calculation, capacity, radius2/3, and continuous offsets unchanged. Both greedy and augmenting edges enforce constraint; no silent unlock.",
